<CENTER><h3><br>NGIT Wins Contract From State of Haryana to Implement Smart CSC Village Project</h3> 
<H3>March 2016</H3>


<html>
<CENTER><h3><br>NGIT Signs Nation Wide Contract with CSC E-Governance Services India</h3> 
<H3>March 2016</H3>
</CENTER>

<CENTER>
<TABLE WIDTH=80% CELLPADDING=10 BORDER=1><TD ALIGN=Justify  style="font-family:verdana;font-size:12px; line-height:2.5">
<!--<TABLE WIDTH=90% CELLPADDING=10 BORDER=1><TR><TH ALIGN=LEFT BGCOLOR="#EEEEFF">-->
 <br>Narayani GhramIT Systems, a Rural IT Park from Chittoor Andhra Pradesh signs a contract to implement Smart Village Project in the state of Haryana. With this, all the Gram Panchayats Field Assets are Geo-Tagged, Monitored and Developed by the VLEs who are operating CSC Centers in these Gram Pacnhayats. People from all sectors will be invited to sponsor for activities they would like to contribute to the Villages of this state.
 </TD>


</TABLE>


